[05:17.38]And in the video we saw,the point about getting good at something is not about having some natural talent.
[05:23.98]It's all about practice, practice, practice.
[05:26.58]W: Definitely yeah.
[05:28.52]Natural talent helps in some way.
[05:31.05]But at the end of the day,you really do need to work hard and get really, really good at what you do.
