[05:39.68]W: I thought one interesting thing in the video was the idea of passion being so important.
[05:45.95]And there're people who really love what they do¡ªof course, you're going to want to work harder and put the time and effort into it.
[05:53.30]And the funny thing is that if you love what you do and are really passionate about it and work really hard,then money kind of comes automatically.
